    .string "Whitewash, every spring.\n"
    .string "Folk ask what was under it.\p"
    .string "Never looked. Not my job.$"

PalletTown_Text_PtarmiganWinter::
    .string "Whitewash, every spring.\n"
    .string "Folk ask what was under it.\p"
    .string "Never looked. Not my job.\p"
    .string "Come winter, I'm white too.$"
